[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8703.59, "timestamp": "02:25:03", "text": "场景 1B 一样，好的部分，坏的部分，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8707.349, "timestamp": "02:25:07", "text": "所有的一切，但我一直热爱"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8709.83, "timestamp": "02:25:09", "text": "生活中的一件事。 不，人生"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8712.309, "timestamp": "02:25:12", "text": "正是一场意想不到的旅程。 无论"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8715.11, "timestamp": "02:25:15", "text": "我多少次过度思考"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8718.469, "timestamp": "02:25:18", "text": "未来、过去，或者"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8721.429, "timestamp": "02:25:21", "text": "在脑海中设想各种各样的场景，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8725.429, "timestamp": "02:25:25", "text": "生活中总会有意想不到的事情发生。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8729.349, "timestamp": "02:25:29", "text": "意料之外的事情会在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8735.03, "timestamp": "02:25:35", "text": "当前时间线中上演。 正确的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8737.349, "timestamp": "02:25:37", "text": "现在我开始……我开始想，是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8739.27, "timestamp": "02:25:39", "text": "不是因为我开始"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8742.23, "timestamp": "02:25:42", "text": "看到一些像闪电侠之类的片段，还有"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 8742.277, "timestamp": "02:25:42", "author": "@sarthaksharma2476", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_kmJohYAdmpQzCNN96t58cLSK8spv6Y2ITutBFF9nvi9Z8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "listen to this"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8745.27, "timestamp": "02:25:45", "text": "很多像跨维度"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 8745.817, "timestamp": "02:25:45", "author": "@sarthaksharma2476", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_kmJohYAdmpQzCNN96t58cLSK8spv6Y2ITutBFF9nvi9Z8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "i go now"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8749.19, "timestamp": "02:25:49", "text": "或多维度电影之类的东西，对吧？我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8753.429, "timestamp": "02:25:53", "text": "现在就像在添加时间线，兄弟，"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 8759.988, "timestamp": "02:25:59", "author": "@sarthaksharma2476", "avatar": "